		<title>OpenAI hires ex-Army Secretary, gaining bipartisan reach just as midterms loom</title>
		<link>https://the-decoder.com/openai-hires-ex-army-secretary-gaining-bipartisan-reach-just-as-midterms-loom/</link>
					<comments>https://the-decoder.com/openai-hires-ex-army-secretary-gaining-bipartisan-reach-just-as-midterms-loom/#respond</comments>
		
